  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual\">Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual</a></i> </p><p>The Durindfire Crystal is found only on the remote <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Outer_Rim\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Outer Rim\">Outer Rim</a> world of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Tatooine\" title=\"Tatooine\">Tatooine</a>. Durindfire Crystals give the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> blades they focus a distinct silver glow. Additionally, when you wield an attuned <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> with a Durindfire Crystal, the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> emits a glow comparable to a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fusion_Lantern\" title=\"Fusion Lantern\">Fusion Lantern</a>, illuminating the area brightly. </p>",
